{"tx":{"msg":[{"@type":"/vm.m_call","caller":"g1npaccm9xucl696fns8j7na44fmeucduflh59uu","send":"","max_deposit":"","pkg_path":"gno.land/r/gnops/valopers","func":"UpdateDescription","args":["g1npaccm9xucl696fns8j7na44fmeucduflh59uu","1. Validator Name: Umair_ChainGuard — multi-chain validator and public infrastructure operator.\n\n2. Networks \u0026 Experience: Currently validating Gno.land Topaz testnet (previously ran as Umair_ChainGuard on Test13 with the same operator address). Also running: Redbelly Network (mainnet), Massa Labs (mainnet), Humanode (mainnet), NexaRail (mainnet), and GenesisL1 — where I operate a validator plus self-hosted public RPC/REST/EVM/WSS infrastructure (GL1Infra) on Cosmos SDK. Broad testnet participation history across multiple ecosystems, with a consistent multi-year track record of running validator and full-node infrastructure across 4 dedicated VPS servers.\n\n3. Digital Presence: Twitter/X: https://x.com/M_Umair_Asif | Discord: muhammad_umair_asif | Telegram: https://t.me/Umair_Asif\n\n4. Contact: Email: umairrajpoot1245@gmail.com | Telegram: https://t.me/Umair_Asif\n\n5. Why validate on gno.land: I run production validator and RPC infrastructure across several ecosystems and want to bring that same operational discipline to gno.land. I value the project's approach to transparent, timeless, and composable smart contracts, and want to contribute reliable, well-monitored infrastructure to support the network's growth from testnet through mainnet.\n\n6. Contributions: I maintain custom Telegram and Discord monitoring bots on all my nodes (sync status, peer count, resource usage, validator status) so that any downtime or issue is caught and resolved immediately, minimizing missed blocks. I also publish setup guides for node/bot deployment on GitHub for the community, and actively manage port/resource allocation across co-hosted nodes to keep infrastructure stable and conflict-free."]}],"fee":{"gas_wanted":"60000000","gas_fee":"1000000ugnot"},"signatures":[{"pub_key":{"@type":"/tm.PubKeySecp256k1","value":"AzmBW7bAcL34dMcEzrYrXWq328jM+4ZNuzwEJXUJRLqe"},"signature":"SnJxyQcE7GYZSLSsVAjfH4I/M0ZnXl8zCfUVdJk3weoQZrPgjpL2ktwdE+Yntd3RYPMkvqlFbGspFU5vKOw8ng=="}],"memo":""},"metadata":{"timestamp":"1785015334"}}
